null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"在读学生","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2024-08-05T17:07:15","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"0000910f-baf8-4738-905f-62a6882a1d7f","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":390691081,"PostDateInt":1722596229000,"PostDate":"2024-08-02T18:57:09","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"战略采购部经理","OrgId":386489,"Org":"集团供应链","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["江苏省·常州市"],"Salary":"20K-25K 元/月","Duty":"1、负责供应链战略采购部管理和运维工作。\n2、负责公司采购总体战略发展方向，总体规划公司采购体系、规划供应链体系。\n3、制定和实施全球采购和供应战略，并与公司业务战略保持一致。\n4、协助供应链总经理对公司供应链团队（需求计划、供应商开发、采购、质量、仓库、物流）的建设和管理工作，配合实施供应链战略规划。\n5、协助建立和健全供应商的开发、维护、跟踪及评估体系，合理控制采购及生产成本。\n6、负责建立供应商体系与评价体系，对重点供应商进行综合评价。\n7、协同生产、质量部门推动供应商产能瓶颈或质量问题的解决，主动管理风险。\n8、配合研发部门、技术部门，优化产品结构，降低采购成本。\n9、根据市场需求，合理制定成品和原材料安全库存计划方案，包括库存结构、库存量的策划实施。\n10、系统地转发所有与采购相关的项目信息(例如，更新的合同条件，供应商管理数据，供应市场情报，商业和技术趋势，基准)，以保持所有利益相关者的最新信息。","Require":"1、熟悉半导体、电子产品、机器人行业优先考虑；\n2、5年以上制造型企业战略采购或供应链管理领域的专业经验，成本分析，谈判经验，自我激励，注重细节，学习能力强。\n3、拥有采购管理、成本控制、质量管理、物流管理方面的工作经验。\n4、优秀的市场调查和趋势分析能力，了解质量管理、财务管理及相关法律法规，具较强的议价、谈判、审核、解决争议解决能力。\n5、拥有良好的团队管理、组织协调能力，有优秀的外部供应商、相关部门沟通协调能力。\n6、为人正直严谨，恪守诚信，有敬业精神及良好的职业道德。\n7、流利的英语和普通话交流。\n8、丰富的谈判专家，有良好的谈判记录和分析能力。","ClassificationOne":"职能","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"5年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2024-08-02T18:57:09","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"0171b2f9-370a-44dd-99a7-dea980f0a43c","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":390688898,"PostDateInt":1721874182000,"PostDate":"2024-07-25T10:23:02","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"高级机械工程师","OrgId":386509,"Org":"机械部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["